# Market data -- NEVER commit. NASDAQ ITCH captures run from hundreds of MB to many GB
# and are not ours to redistribute. Regenerate with `python tools_download.py` (real
# data) or `python -m itch generate` (synthetic). See data/PROVENANCE.md.
#
# Everything under data/ is ignored except the provenance notes, two small JSON stat
# files, and the hand-built test vectors in data/fixtures/ (no real market data).
data/*
!data/PROVENANCE.md
!data/prefix_validation.json
!data/sample_truncated.stats.json
!data/fixtures/
*.itch
!data/fixtures/**/*.itch
*.gz
*.md5sum
*.NASDAQ_ITCH50*
# 500,000 real exchange messages (14 MB). Kept local; rebuild it from the prefix with
# the recipe in data/PROVENANCE.md section 7.
data/sample_truncated.itch

# Derived artefacts and run logs
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
itch.db
*.log

# Internal work logs
PROGRESS*.md

